# Secrets FIRST. `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile copies this whole directory, and CLAUDE.md's own
# setup recipe has every developer create an api/.env holding a service_role key — so without
# these two lines the production image ships with a developer's local secrets baked into a layer,
# and pydantic-settings (env_file=".env") reads them at runtime for anything Fly does not set.
.env
.env.*

.venv
__pycache__
tests
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
